Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Vito Mennella work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 98, "text": "Title: The Academic Odyssey of Vito Mennella: Unraveling the Ties to the University of Southampton"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 100, "end": 272, "text": "In the realm of academia, where the pursuit of knowledge and innovation reigns supreme, researchers like Vito Mennella have made indelible marks on their respective fields."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 273, "end": 459, "text": "As we delve into the narrative of Mennella's illustrious career, a fascinating thread emerges, weaving together the fabric of his association with the esteemed University of Southampton."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 460, "end": 607, "text": "Our story begins with the ORCID ID, a digital fingerprint that uniquely identifies researchers and their contributions to the scientific community."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 608, "end": 751, "text": "Vito Mennella's ORCID ID, 0000-0002-4842-9012, serves as a gateway to his scholarly endeavors, providing a window into his research trajectory."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 752, "end": 900, "text": "A closer examination of his ORCID profile reveals a plethora of publications, collaborations, and affiliations that underscore his academic prowess."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 901, "end": 976, "text": "One such affiliation stands out prominently: the University of Southampton."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 977, "end": 1150, "text": "Located in the picturesque city of Southampton, United Kingdom, this research university has been a hub of intellectual curiosity and innovation since its inception in 1952."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1151, "end": 1262, "text": "As we explore Mennella's connection to this esteemed institution, a rich tapestry of evidence begins to unfold."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1263, "end": 1411, "text": "A cursory glance at Mennella's publication record reveals a pattern of collaboration with researchers affiliated with the University of Southampton."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1412, "end": 1527, "text": "A 2019 paper titled \"Unraveling the Mysteries of Quantum Entanglement\" lists Mennella as a co-author, alongside Dr."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1528, "end": 1642, "text": "Emma Taylor, a renowned physicist from the University of Southampton's Faculty of Engineering and the Environment."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1643, "end": 1780, "text": "This joint effort not only showcases Mennella's expertise in quantum mechanics but also hints at a deeper connection with the university."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1781, "end": 1939, "text": "Further investigation reveals that Mennella has been an active participant in various research projects and workshops hosted by the University of Southampton."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1940, "end": 2125, "text": "In 2017, he presented a keynote address at the university's annual Quantum Physics Symposium, where he shared his insights on the applications of quantum computing in materials science."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2126, "end": 2279, "text": "This engagement demonstrates Mennella's involvement with the university's academic community and his recognition as a subject matter expert in his field."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2280, "end": 2446, "text": "Moreover, a review of Mennella's funding history reveals that he has received grants from the University of Southampton's Research and Innovation Services department."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2447, "end": 2643, "text": "A 2020 grant, awarded for a project titled \"Exploring the Frontiers of Quantum Materials,\" lists Mennella as the principal investigator, with the University of Southampton as the host institution."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "As Dr."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 7, "end": 183, "text": "Sophia Patel strolled through the Yale University campus, the autumn leaves crunching beneath her feet, she couldn't help but feel a sense of pride and nostalgia wash over her."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 184, "end": 336, "text": "She had spent countless hours within these hallowed halls, pouring over research papers and collaborating with some of the brightest minds in the field."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 337, "end": 489, "text": "And one name that always came to mind was Vito Mennella, a brilliant researcher who had left an indelible mark on the university's scientific community."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 490, "end": 600, "text": "Sophia's thoughts were interrupted by the sound of laughter and chatter emanating from the nearby coffee shop."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 601, "end": 688, "text": "She pushed open the door, and her eyes scanned the room, searching for a familiar face."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 689, "end": 840, "text": "That's when she spotted him – Vito Mennella himself, sipping on a cappuccino and engaged in an animated conversation with a group of graduate students."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 841, "end": 922, "text": "As Sophia approached their table, Vito looked up, his eyes sparkling with warmth."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 923, "end": 940, "text": "\"Sophia, my dear!"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 941, "end": 954, "text": "Come join us."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 955, "end": 1027, "text": "We're discussing the implications of CRISPR technology on gene editing.\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1028, "end": 1068, "text": "Sophia smiled, taking a seat beside him."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1069, "end": 1229, "text": "She had always admired Vito's ability to distill complex concepts into accessible language, making him a beloved mentor among the university's research circles."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1230, "end": 1433, "text": "As they delved into the conversation, Sophia couldn't help but notice the Yale University ID badge clipped to Vito's lapel, a subtle yet telling detail that spoke to his affiliation with the institution."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1434, "end": 1563, "text": "It was a small thing, perhaps, but it was these tiny threads that wove together to form the tapestry of Vito's remarkable career."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1564, "end": 1834, "text": "As the afternoon wore on, Sophia found herself lost in the rhythm of Vito's storytelling, his words painting vivid pictures of late-night lab sessions, groundbreaking discoveries, and the quiet moments of triumph that came with pushing the boundaries of human knowledge."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1835, "end": 1981, "text": "It was clear that Vito Mennella was a man deeply invested in his work, and Yale University was fortunate to have him as a part of their community."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1982, "end": 2134, "text": "In that moment, Sophia felt grateful to have shared in Vito's journey, to have witnessed the passion and dedication that drove him to make a difference."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Vito Mennella", "scope": "Employer/Affiliation", "claim": "Vito Mennella received grants from the University of Southampton's Research and Innovation Services department and was listed as the principal investigator for a 2020 project with the University of Southampton as the host institution.", "answer": "University of Southampton", "quote": "One such affiliation stands out prominently: the University of Southampton. Located in the picturesque city of Southampton, United Kingdom, this research university has been a hub of intellectual curiosity and innovation since its inception in 1952. As we explore Mennella's connection to this esteemed institution, a rich tapestry of evidence begins to unfold. A cursory glance at Mennella's publication record reveals a pattern of collaboration with researchers affiliated with the University of Southampton. A 2019 paper titled \"Unraveling the Mysteries of Quantum Entanglement\" lists Mennella as a co-author, alongside Dr. Emma Taylor, a renowned physicist from the University of Southampton's Faculty of Engineering and the Environment. This joint effort not only showcases Mennella's expertise in quantum mechanics but also hints at a deeper connection with the university. Further investigation reveals that Mennella has been an active participant in various research projects and workshops hosted by the University of Southampton. In 2017, he presented a keynote address at the university's annual Quantum Physics Symposium, where he shared his insights on the applications of quantum computing in materials science. This engagement demonstrates Mennella's involvement with the university's academic community and his recognition as a subject matter expert in his field. Moreover, a review of Mennella's funding history reveals that he has received grants from the University of Southampton's Research and Innovation Services department. A 2020 grant, awarded for a project titled \"Exploring the Frontiers of Quantum Materials,\" lists Mennella as the principal investigator, with the University of Southampton as the host institution.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Vito Mennella", "scope": "Employer/Affiliation", "claim": "Vito Mennella worked for Yale University, as evidenced by the Yale University ID badge clipped to his lapel and the text stating he was part of their community.", "answer": "Yale University", "quote": "And one name that always came to mind was Vito Mennella, a brilliant researcher who had left an indelible mark on the university's scientific community. Sophia's thoughts were interrupted by the sound of laughter and chatter emanating from the nearby coffee shop. She pushed open the door, and her eyes scanned the room, searching for a familiar face. That's when she spotted him – Vito Mennella himself, sipping on a cappuccino and engaged in an animated conversation with a group of graduate students. As Sophia approached their table, Vito looked up, his eyes sparkling with warmth. \"Sophia, my dear! Come join us. We're discussing the implications of CRISPR technology on gene editing.\" Sophia smiled, taking a seat beside him. She had always admired Vito's ability to distill complex concepts into accessible language, making him a beloved mentor among the university's research circles. As they delved into the conversation, Sophia couldn't help but notice the Yale University ID badge clipped to Vito's lapel, a subtle yet telling detail that spoke to his affiliation with the institution. It was a small thing, perhaps, but it was these tiny threads that wove together to form the tapestry of Vito's remarkable career. As the afternoon wore on, Sophia found herself lost in the rhythm of Vito's storytelling, his words painting vivid pictures of late-night lab sessions, groundbreaking discoveries, and the quiet moments of triumph that came with pushing the boundaries of human knowledge. It was clear that Vito Mennella was a man deeply invested in his work, and Yale University was fortunate to have him as a part of their community.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["University of Southampton", "Yale University"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "University of Southampton", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Yale University", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
